# Regenerable build output — not committed.
#
# Everything here is produced by ../tools/*.js. What IS committed is the prototype's own
# per-section capture (proto-i<N>.png, proto-i<N>-open.png) and the literal/CSS dumps, because
# those are the reference the port is verified against: the prototype renders only by pulling
# React from unpkg, so if that ever stops working the ground truth is gone and unreproducible.
#
# These, by contrast, are re-made in about two minutes on every run:

# our side of the diff
ours-*.png
ours-i1-geometry.json
boxes-ours.json

# the comparisons themselves
diff-*.png
sxs-*.png
crop-*.png

# full-page shots — 5.4MB between them, and the per-section captures above cover the same ground.
# Regenerate with tools/capture.js + tools/capture-open.js when P1g (the full-page diff) runs.
proto-institutional-full.png
proto-institutional-full-open.png
proto-institutional-viewport.png
